Godot ToI: opt-in UTC timeline for declared fMP4 HLS epochs

Apply after hls-custom-https-io.patch to FFmpeg n9.0.2.
Single-track unencrypted H264/AAC only; unsupported layouts/codecs, missing
UTC anchors, invalid dates and large UTC gaps remain errors. The EOF barrier
keeps packet read-ahead/probe buffers in their original epoch. Reopening reads
the new MAP and forwards codec extradata. All opens retain parent io_open,
interrupt callbacks and the existing nested-file restrictions. Default off.

